Third-party software

canon-webcam links dynamically against libgphoto2 and libgphoto2_port
(https://github.com/gphoto/libgphoto2) and libusb (https://libusb.info), which
are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later. They are
not included in this repository; install them separately (for example with
`brew install libgphoto2`, which also installs libusb).
